        "text": "You are analyzing screenshots for a LinkedIn post. Look at every image carefully.\n\nFor EACH image provided, write exactly 3 sentences:\n1. What is shown on screen (app, dashboard, tool, content type)\n2. Key visible text, data, metrics, or UI elements you can read\n3. The professional context and what this demonstrates\n\nFormat your response exactly like this:\nImage 1: [your 3 sentences]\nImage 2: [your 3 sentences — only if a second image exists]\n\nBe factual, specific, and professional.",
